41:["$","pre","pre-1",{"data-language":"MARKDOWN","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-markdown","children":["请根据以下信息生成 3 条快捷追问建议。\n\n",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"xml","children":["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-tag","children":["<",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-name","children":"current_user_input"}],">"]}]}],"\n{{CURRENT",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-emphasis","children":"_USER_"}],"INPUT}}\n",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"xml","children":["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-tag","children":["</",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-name","children":"current_user_input"}],">"]}]}],"\n\n",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"xml","children":["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-tag","children":["<",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-name","children":"assistant_last_response"}],">"]}]}],"\n{{ASSISTANT",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-emphasis","children":"_LAST_"}],"RESPONSE}}\n",["$","span","span-5",{"className":"xml","children":["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-tag","children":["</",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-name","children":"assistant_last_response"}],">"]}]}],"\n\n",["$","span","span-6",{"className":"xml","children":["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-tag","children":["<",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-name","children":"relevant_context"}],">"]}]}],"\n{{RELEVANT",["$","span","span-7",{"className":"hljs-emphasis","children":["_CONTEXT}}\n",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"xml","children":["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-tag","children":["</",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-name","children":"relevant_context"}],">"]}]}],"\n\n你生成的 3 条快捷追问建议是：\n"]}]]}]}]
42:["$","p","p-37",{"children":"这种方案的优点就是实现简单、架构简洁，可以快速看到效果，而且由于模型的输出内容非常简洁明了，一般 RT 也是比较短的。事实上，如果你的业务场景比较简单、边界比较清晰，或是在项目启动初期，笔者是很推荐使用该方案的，基本上经过简单的提示词和上下文调优，也是可以达到也合格的水准的。如果在加上简单的后训练，用专门的模型去承担该生成任务的话，相信可以进一步抬高下限。"}]
43:["$","p","p-38",{"children":"但是在复杂场景，如笔者所面临的二手电商买家场景，那就复杂得多了。这个时候如果你的业务体量比较大，那所有的边界 case 都不容忽视。如前文所述，该方案经过多轮调优后，笔者在实践过程中仍然遇到了诸多问题，且概率不低。"}]
44:["$","h3","h3-6",{"id":"32-引入-actionspec","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#32-引入-actionspec","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#32-引入-actionspec"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.2 引入 ActionSpec","position":{"start":{"line":251,"column":5,"offset":7023},"end":{"line":251,"column":22,"offset":7040}}}]},"children":"3.2 引入 ActionSpec"}]}]
45:["$","p","p-39",{"children":"在复杂业务场景中，我们首先要做的事情就是提高控制权，这是为了将一个无限的开放问题限制在一个可控的有限集合中，这可以大大减小系统的不可控性。另外就是要引入可理解性，这是为了让我们分析 bad case 的时候有理可据。"}]
46:["$","p","p-40",{"children":["这个时候我们可以把 Agent 支持的能力，枚举成若干个 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Action"}],"，每一个 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Action"}]," 定义一个 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ActionSpec"}],"，让模型在 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ActionList"}]," 中进行挑选，比如让模型输出："]}]
