5a:["$","ol","ol-4",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"可控性提高：将 suggestion 的可选方向从 LLM 随机发挥的无限集合收拢到程序控制的有限集合中，同时也引入了 metadata 供程序进行结构化校验。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"可插拔化：这个不赘述。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"引入可理解性：不再是单独输出 suggestion 文案，还让模型输出了 reason，这在一定程度也是一个 CoT 的过程，可以提高模型输出的稳定性。"}],"\n"]}]
5b:["$","p","p-53",{"children":"缺点："}]
5c:["$","ol","ol-5",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"依旧是一个模型包揽一切，跟第一个方案本质上还是没有区别。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"如果业务上强制要求 3 条 suggestion，为了防止 metadata 过滤后导致条数不足，那就需要进行冗余输出，当然仍然可能会出现条数不足的情况，这里是建议宁缺毋滥。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"输出结构复杂度提升了，RT 会增加不少，甚至可能会输出非法 JSON，需要有对应的修复 JSON 的逻辑兜底。"}],"\n"]}]
5d:["$","h3","h3-7",{"id":"33-selectorwriter","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#33-selectorwriter","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#33-selectorwriter"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.3 selector+writer","position":{"start":{"line":433,"column":5,"offset":10850},"end":{"line":433,"column":24,"offset":10869}}}]},"children":"3.3 selector+writer"}]}]
5e:["$","p","p-54",{"children":["方案二只是限制了模型的输出空间；方案三进一步限制了每个模型节点的认知任务。这个方案的出发点是想将模型的职责进行拆分，如我们前面分析，生成 suggestion list 其实并不是一件简单的事情，它不是\"生成 3 个追问建议\"，而应该是",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"根据当前对话状态，从可执行动作集合中选择 0~3 个高价值下一步，并渲染成用户可点击的自然语言。"}]]}]
5f:["$","p","p-55",{"children":["所以这里笔者的核心思路是将",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"方向选择"}],"和",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"文案生成"}],"，拆成 2 个节点，前者专门负责方向选择，后者仅需将选择好的合法方向渲染成合适的文案即可。整个流程就变成了："]}]
60:["$","$L88","pre-9,code-0",{"source":"flowchart LR\n    A[上下文 + 预过滤后的 ActionSpec]\n    --> B[方向选择<br/>选择 0~3 个 Action]\n    --> C[程序化校验<br/>Action / Metadata]\n    --> D[文案渲染<br/>生成用户口吻 Text]\n    --> E[suggestion list]"}]
61:["$","p","p-56",{"children":"这里方向选择有 2 种大方向可以选择："}]
62:["$","ul","ul-6",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"程序化决策"}],"：如果业务流程的状态流转是有明确可识别信号的，可以在程序内部就确定当前属于什么状态，下一步可以是什么状态，那是最理想的，这个时候，可以直接用代码逻辑选择合适的方向。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"大模型识别"}],"：多数复杂的业务场景可能无法提供那么清晰化的状态流转信号，尤其是 Chatbot 类型的应用，比如笔者负责的二手电商买家侧 Agent，买家的动作是不可预估的，购买任务也不是线性一路走到黑的，而是一个错综复杂的流转过程。这个时候，定义状态机是不现实的。更现实的思路是，不在乎过往的一切状态，仅聚焦在当前所在的位置，从当前节点出发，去判断能往哪些方向前行。这个时候往往我们能拿到的信息都是自然语言文本，确定性程序是解决不了的，或者说是不够灵活、难以全面覆盖的。这个时候，反而就是大模型优势之所在了，语言理解，恰恰是大模型的强项。"]}],"\n"]}]
63:["$","$L88","pre-10,code-0",{"source":"flowchart LR\n    B[完整 ActionSpec] --> C[ActionSpec 预过滤]\n    A[当前对话上下文] --> C\n\n    C --> D{是否存在明确业务信号?}\n    D -->|是| E[程序化 Selector]\n    D -->|否| F[Selector LLM]\n\n    E --> G[0~3 个 Action + Metadata]\n    F --> G\n\n    G --> H[程序化校验]\n    H --> I[Writer LLM]\n    A -.-> I\n\n    I --> J[suggestion list]"}]
64:["$","p","p-57",{"children":["这个时候，我们需要丰富一下 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ActionSpec"}]," 的定义："]}]
65:["$","pre","pre-11",{"data-language":"RUST","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-rust","children":[["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 动作规约"}],"\n",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-keyword","children":"struct"}]," ",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-title class_","children":"ActionSpec"}]," {\n  action: Action,      \t\t\t\t\t",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 动作类型"}],"\n  description: ",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"String"}],", \t\t\t\t\t",["$","span","span-5",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 动作说明，给开发者看的"}],"\n  metadata: ",["$","span","span-6",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"Option"}],"<Metadata>, \t",["$","span","span-7",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 该动作对应的元数据，可选"}],"\n  enabled: ",["$","span","span-8",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"bool"}],",\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",["$","span","span-9",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 该动作是否可用"}],"\n  select_condition: ",["$","span","span-10",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"String"}],", \t\t",["$","span","span-11",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 选择条件，告诉模型什么情况下可以选择这个 action，什么时候不选择"}],"\n  validate: ",["$","span","span-12",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"Option"}],"<Func>\t\t\t\t",["$","span","span-13",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 校验 metadata 的处理函数，可选"}],"\n  text_guide: ",["$","span","span-14",{"className":"hljs-type","children":"String"}],",\t\t\t\t\t\t",["$","span","span-15",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 这个 action 对应的 text 要怎么写，有哪些原则需要遵循"}],"\n\t\n  ",["$","span","span-16",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 新增 build_text_guide"}],"\n  build_text_guide: Func<Metadata> ",["$","span","span-17",{"className":"hljs-comment","children":"// 这个 action 对应的 text 要怎么写，有哪些原则需要遵循，动态注入 Metadata 对应的实体的详细信息"}],"\n}\n"]}]}]
66:["$","p","p-58",{"children":["我们可以新增一个 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"build_text_guide"}]," 的函数来替代固定的 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"text_guide"}]," 文本，它的好处是可以根据 Selector LLM 输出的 metadata，动态注入其指定的实体的详细信息，这样 Writer LLM 的关注点会更聚焦。"]}]
67:["$","p","p-59",{"children":["举个例子，比如我们的 Action 是 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"compare_product"}],"（商品比较），那 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"metadata"}]," 就是 2 个 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"product_id"}],"（商品 ID），这 2 个 ID 是 Selector LLM 在 n 个商品列表中选择的要比较的 2 个商品，我们需要把整个商品列表的信息给到 Selector LLM。这时候在注入上下文给 Writer LLM 的时候，我们可以根据 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"product_id"}]," 查出商品的详细信息，然后",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"仅仅"}],"注入这 2 个商品的信息给到 Writer LLM，这样 Writer LLM 就会聚焦在这 2 个商品上，而不会被其他商品信息分散了注意力，这可以大大降低幻觉的概率。"]}]
68:["$","p","p-60",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jul%2023,%202026,%2009_52_35%20PM%20(5).png","alt":"","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jul%2023,%202026,%2009_52_35%20PM%20(5).png","alt":""},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":494,"column":1,"offset":13019},"end":{"line":494,"column":118,"offset":13136}}}}]}]
69:["$","p","p-61",{"children":"笔者经过实验，在我们的业务场景上，满分 100 分的情况下，仅生成的 suggestion list 的质量这一个维度，该方案可以比 LLM 直出高 20 分左右。更重要的是，这个方案在架构、产品迭代和稳定性方面带来的增益，也是不可忽视的。"}]
6a:["$","p","p-62",{"children":"唯一的缺点就是，方向选择这一关节点如果无法进行程序化决策，而只能由大模型进行选择的话，那就会多一次 LLM 调用，RT 会进一步增加。这个情况下，就需要分别针对 Selector 和 Writer 训练专门的小模型来进一步压缩 RT 了。那如果 RT 依旧是业务无法接受的情况下，退一步讲，你也可以用该架构生成优质的 suggestion list 来作为方案一微调时的训练数据。"}]
6b:["$","h3","h3-8",{"id":"34-selectorwriterverifier","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#34-selectorwriterverifier","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#34-selectorwriterverifier"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.4 selector+writer+verifier","position":{"start":{"line":500,"column":5,"offset":13456},"end":{"line":500,"column":33,"offset":13484}}}]},"children":"3.4 selector+writer+verifier"}]}]
6c:["$","p","p-63",{"children":"在实践过程中，方案三已经可以达到比较高的水位了，通过控制给到 Writer LLM 的上下文范围，可以极大降低模型幻觉的概率。不过依旧无法避免，你依旧无法避免模型在为多个 Action 生成 suggestion 的时候，出现张冠李戴等幻觉错误。"}]
6d:["$","p","p-64",{"children":["这个时候如果要进一步降低出错概率，那可以在输出之前引入一个后置校验节点 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"verifier"}],"。"]}]
6e:["$","$L88","pre-12,code-0",{"source":"flowchart LR\n    A[Selector LLM<br/>选择 Action + Metadata]\n    --> B[程序化校验]\n    --> C[Writer LLM<br/>生成 Suggestion Text]\n    --> D[Verifier<br/>校验 Action、实体与文案是否一致]\n    --> E{通过?}\n\n    E -->|是| F[返回 suggestion list]\n    E -->|否| G[丢弃或重试]"}]
6f:["$","p","p-65",{"children":"但是这个时候就不太推荐再引入一个大模型来进行校验了，可以针对一些高频、高危的场景，做一些简单的程序化校验，如内部实体 ID 的检测、高危敏感词的正则匹配等。"}]
70:["$","h2","h2-3",{"id":"4-实践建议","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#4-实践建议","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#4-实践建议"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"4. 实践建议","position":{"start":{"line":520,"column":4,"offset":13997},"end":{"line":520,"column":11,"offset":14004}}}]},"children":"4. 实践建议"}]}]
71:["$","p","p-66",{"children":"先回顾一下 4 个方案的演进过程："}]
72:["$","table","table-0",{"children":[["$","thead","thead-0",{"children":["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","th","th-0",{"children":"方案"}],["$","th","th-1",{"children":"主要解决的问题"}],["$","th","th-2",{"children":"仍然存在的问题"}]]}]}],["$","tbody","tbody-0",{"children":[["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"纯 LLM 直出"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"快速生成，低成本接入"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"模型自由发挥，能力越界，结果不可解释"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-1",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"ActionSpec + 单 LLM"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"将无限生成空间收敛到有限 Action 集合，并支持结构化校验"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"方向选择和文案生成仍由同一个模型完成，职责过重"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-2",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Selector + Writer"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"拆分方向选择与文案生成，并通过精简上下文降低张冠李戴和幻觉"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Writer 仍可能生成与 Action、Metadata 不一致的文案"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-3",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Selector + Writer + Verifier"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"在输出前增加最后一道一致性与安全性校验"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"RT、成本和系统复杂度进一步上升"}]]}]]}]]}]
73:["$","p","p-67",{"children":"它们的对比总结如下："}]
74:["$","p","p-68",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jul%2023,%202026,%2009_52_36%20PM%20(6).png","alt":"","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jul%2023,%202026,%2009_52_36%20PM%20(6).png","alt":""},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":533,"column":1,"offset":14769},"end":{"line":533,"column":118,"offset":14886}}}}]}]
75:["$","p","p-69",{"children":"四个方案不是互斥的技术路线，而是一条逐步增加控制权的演进路径：从让模型自由生成，到约束动作空间，再到拆分决策与表达，最后增加后置校验。系统每向后演进一步，通常都会获得更高的稳定性和可控性，同时付出更高的 RT、成本与工程复杂度。"}]
76:["$","p","p-70",{"children":"在实践的过程中，我们没必要去盲目套用这里面的任何方案，核心是要先明确不同实现方式的强项在哪里，再根据自己的业务背景和项目架构进行灵活选择："}]
77:["$","ul","ul-7",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"程序化"}],"：结构化、强状态、可明确枚举的场景，通常具有更低延迟、更强可控性和更高确定性。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"大模型"}],"：适合非结构化、需要语境理解、不可穷举、个性化文本生成。"]}],"\n"]}]
78:["$","p","p-71",{"children":"最终实现的效果如何，我们还是需要搭建一套评测链路来进行评测比较，才能下结论。"}]
79:["$","p","p-72",{"children":"而现在这种 AI Agent 应用跟传统的互联网应用又不一样，它无法像我们之前的确定性逻辑一样，快速回归一下单元测试或集成测试，或是简单跑一个批量脚本，就可以得到改进的效果数据。整条链路是不确定性和复杂度会大很多。"}]
7a:["$","p","p-73",{"children":"但是利用 AI，我们可以在实践过程中总结一下 SKILL 来串起整个过程，从而提高我们迭代的自动化程度和效率，把冗长、重复的执行过程交给 AI 去做，从而解放自己。"}]
7b:["$","p","p-74",{"children":"这里笔者结合自己的实践，给出一些建议供各位读者参考："}]
7c:["$","ul","ul-8",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"整个 Agent 所有的执行链路，包括但不限于模型调用、工具调用和中间件调用等，都落好 trace，尤其是出入参和耗时。同时可以总结一个根据 traceID 自动拉取 trace 明细并结合代码分析问题的 SKILL。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"评测平台要能直接拉取线上、测试环境的 trace，并将它们沉淀为待评测数据集，并制定相关的评测指标，使用 LLM as a Judge 进行测评活动。同时可以总结一个分析整个数据集评测结果、或者分析单条 bad case 的 SKILL，这样可以直接让 AI 拉取评测结果 case 并结合评测结果、trace、代码综合分析问题所在，并给出改进建议。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"评测平台拉下来的 trace，还可以作为系统回放的仿真数据集，这样在系统迭代时，我们可以用真实的流量进行回放，并对比回放结果的评测表现，从而判断系统的水位起伏。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["将上面 3 个串起来，我们就可以再总结一个自我迭代的 SKILL，我们只需要指定好评测标准，给到目标分数，让 AI 自己跑整个迭代循环，如：",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"优化代码 > 仿真回放 > 运行评测 > 分析评测结果 > 拉取 bad case trace > 归因分析 > 优化代码/调整评测标准 > 直到达到目标或最大迭代次数"}],"。"]}],"\n"]}]
7d:["$","$L8","img-2",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jul%2023,%202026,%2009_52_36%20PM%20(7).png","style":{"zoom":"33%"},"node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jul%2023,%202026,%2009_52_36%20PM%20(7).png","style":"zoom: 33%;"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":555,"column":1,"offset":15958},"end":{"line":555,"column":146,"offset":16103}}}}]
7e:["$","h2","h2-4",{"id":"5-过程反思","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#5-过程反思","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#5-过程反思"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"5. 过程反思","position":{"start":{"line":557,"column":4,"offset":16108},"end":{"line":557,"column":11,"offset":16115}}}]},"children":"5. 过程反思"}]}]
7f:["$","p","p-75",{"children":"在实践过程中，笔者也走了一些弯路，这里简单做下总结，可供参考："}]
80:["$","ul","ul-9",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["AI 在修改提示词或者代码的时候，很喜欢根据 bad case 进行 case by case 针对性修复，如 prompt 里面直接将评测数据集中的 case 指定为正例或反例，或是在代码里面使用正则匹配、字符串过滤等硬编码逻辑。一定要警惕这种行为，要在 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"CLAUDE.md"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"AGENTS.md"}]," 里面明令禁止，要明确要求 AI 在撰写 prompt 和编码的过程中，要抽象出 bad case 背后的通用性原则，而不是进行硬编码。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"现在很多人不仅是 vibe coding，prompt 大部分也都是 AI 写的，这在一开始是没有问题的，但是随着 AI 自身的不断迭代，prompt 会变得非常冗长、重复、多余、矛盾、不可理解，这个时候，人工介入进行手工重写，是很有必要的。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"仿真回放的时候没有必要走整个业务流程（ Agent + suggestion list），可以固定 Agent 的输出，作为快照，在仿真的时候，直接进入 suggestion list 节点，这样既可以稳定场景进行不断复现比较，也可以省资源，同时效率也会大大提升。"}],"\n"]}]
81:["$","h2","h2-5",{"id":"6-总结","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#6-总结","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#6-总结"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"6. 总结","position":{"start":{"line":567,"column":4,"offset":16640},"end":{"line":567,"column":9,"offset":16645}}}]},"children":"6. 总结"}]}]
82:["$","p","p-76",{"children":"suggestion list 的本质不是\"生成几个追问\"，而是帮助 Agent 在当前对话状态下选择一个高价值、可执行的下一步，并将其转换成用户可理解的自然语言。对于简单场景，纯 LLM 生成已经足够；但在复杂业务中，需要逐步引入 ActionSpec、Selector/Writer 拆分以及 Verifier 等机制，将模型的自由发挥约束在可控范围内。同时，AI Agent 的优化也不能依赖人工调 Prompt，而应该结合 Trace、评测、Bad Case 分析和仿真回放，建立持续迭代闭环，最终实现稳定、可控、可演进的 Agent 系统。"}]
83:["$","p","p-77",{"children":"另外，除了静态的评测结果，还需结合点击率、点击后继续对话率、任务完成率、退出率，以及相对无 suggestion 对照组的任务成功率提升等业务指标来综合判断我们的快捷追问组件是否真的能起到推动用户完成任务的作用。"}]
84:["$","div",null,{"className":"article-tags","children":[["$","span","AI Agent",{"className":"p-category","children":["#","AI Agent"]}]]}]
